ly mad. Now deprived of the wisdom of their beloved druid and the protection provided by his magic potion, the Armorican village falls prey to a proclaimed soothsayer who comes with ominous predictions and overweening ambitions. It's up to Asterix to keep his villager friends within reason and hopefully get Getafix to remember the magic potion's recipe before the impending Roman attack."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Lorsqu'Obélix percute le pauvre Panoramix avec un menhir, le druide s'évanouit et, au réveil, devient incapable de retrouver la formule de sa potion magique. Astérix et son fidèle compagnon vont alors devoir s'employer pour déjouer les tours des Romains et d'un étrange devin..."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fEm3xIWUw6hEpSrVeEe2Tx3gjDy.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fEm3xIWUw6hEpSrVeEe2Tx3gjDy.png","language":"en","width":190,"height":104},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bxaYGxXnt9Xf2FY3rxrKvhl85Vz.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bxaYGxXnt9Xf2FY3rxrKvhl85Vz.png","language":"fr","width":511,"height":295},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v6HXUjjOq4eK9tYEvNBdo1Kcm3T.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v6HXUjjOq4eK9tYEvNBdo1Kcm3T.png","language":"fr","width":511,"height":295}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dOLC7Ag315bihu7NJAxNGnNfojF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dOLC7Ag315bihu7NJAxNGnNfojF.jpg","language":"it","width":795,"height":1119},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oOX1LtA75OQedRolHYYxsRhX797.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oOX1LtA75OQedRolHYYxsRhX797.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rhoGC3R62BwiKpqU05J6evpzaok.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rhoGC3R62BwiKpqU05J6evpzaok.jpg","language":"it","width":7